    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "The organiser removes a member. No vote, no automatic trigger.\\n\\nNobody is removed AUTOMATICALLY for not paying \\xe2\\x80\\x94 there is no violation\\ncounter and no auto-kick. A member who does not pay simply blocks the\\nround until they pay after all (a late share cures it), the\\norganiser freezes them (this door), or the organiser resets the round\\n(pause + `void_round`, system-only). But a circle still needs that\\ndoor: someone unreachable,\\nsomeone who asked to leave off-chain, someone who should not have been\\nlet in \\xe2\\x80\\x94 and, yes, someone stalling a round. In an acquaintance circle\\nthat call belongs to the person who assembled it, not to a 60% vote\\namong people who all know each other anyway.\\n\\nRemoval is not confiscation. It goes through the SAME door as a\\nvoluntary exit (`begin_exit`): an IMMEDIATE freeze that drops them\\nfrom every round's obligations and refunds any contribution they had\\nstaged into a live round. The record and its slot are KEPT \\xe2\\x80\\x94 slots\\nare never reused, they are the circle's seats for life. Nobody is\\n",
      "name": "remove_member",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "member",
          "type_": "address"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "u64",
            "error_type": "error"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
